  "instructions": [
    "Heat the infuse-oil in a kadhai over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the asparagus and cook for 3 minutes until tender.",
    "Add the salmon fillets and cook for 4 minutes per side until cooked through.",
    "In a small bowl, mix the mayonnaise and lemon juice.",
    "Serve the salmon with the mayonnaise mixture spooned over the top.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley or dill if desired."
